rounded-t-xl: Rounds only the Top.
rounded-b-xl: Rounds only the Bottom.
rounded-l-xl: Rounds only the Left.
rounded-r-xl: Rounds only the Right.

Tailwind Class      Pixels
rounded-none          0px
rounded-sm            2px
rounded               4px
rounded-md            6px
rounded-lg            8px
rounded-xl            12px
rounded-2xl          16px
rounded-3xl          24px
rounded-full      Circle / Pill


---===Sides (Two Corners)===---

rounded-t-2xl → Top-left & Top-right
rounded-b-2xl → Bottom-left & Bottom-right
rounded-l-2xl → Top-left & Bottom-left
rounded-r-2xl → Top-right & Bottom-right

---=== Single Corners ===---

rounded-tl-2xl → Top-left only
rounded-tr-2xl → Top-right only
rounded-bl-2xl → Bottom-left only
rounded-br-2xl → Bottom-right only
Arbitrary Values

If you need an exact size outside the default scale, use square brackets:

rounded-[10px]
rounded-[50px]
